  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot.\n• Zest lime to get a generous pinch and cut into wedges.\n• Pick and roughly chop mint.\n• Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6768c67d555c15a993e4ec70-45deadec.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook tofu, tossing, until browned and warmed through, 3-4 minutes.\n• Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6768c67d555c15a993e4ec70-bae0550d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While tofu is cooking, combine sweet chilli sauce and lime zest in a small bowl. Set aside.\n• In a medium bowl, combine shredded cabbage mix, carrot, mint, a squeeze of lime juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Microwave mini flourtortillas on a plate in 10 second bursts, or until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6768c67d555c15a993e4ec70-dc70fa96.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Top tortillas with some mint slaw and satay tofu.\n• Drizzle over sesame dressing.\n• Sprinkle with crispy shallots and serve with sweet chilli sauce. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6768c67d555c15a993e4ec70-03e61029.jpeg"
    }
  ]
